.TH "libnvme_free" 9 "libnvme_free" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvme_free \- Free allocated memory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvme_free
.BI "(void *p "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "p" 12
Memory buffer to free
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Releases memory previously allocated by \fBlibnvme_alloc\fP,
\fBlibnvme_realloc\fP, or related libnvme allocation helpers.
